01:04:36,680 --> 01:04:37,460
We have money.

888
01:04:37,900 --> 01:04:38,660
We can do whatever we want.

889
01:04:39,500 --> 01:04:41,740
P'Tan, this guy is the boss.

890
01:04:42,300 --> 01:04:43,660
No one can stop us.

891
01:04:45,560 --> 01:04:47,000
I'm going to hit you.

892
01:05:05,890 --> 01:05:06,730
I'm tired.

893
01:05:08,130 --> 01:05:09,090
My body is red.

894
01:05:18,700 --> 01:05:19,980
I'm tired.

895
01:05:21,640 --> 01:05:22,760
I have a reward.

896
01:05:45,430 --> 01:05:47,910
Do you think we're dogs or pigs?

897
01:05:48,790 --> 01:05:50,090
You think we're toys?

898
01:05:52,270 --> 01:05:54,050
You guys are like us.

899
01:05:54,830 --> 01:05:56,030
Let's play together.

900
01:05:56,290 --> 01:05:57,030
No, Han.

901
01:05:57,290 --> 01:05:58,330
Don't kill me.

902
01:05:58,770 --> 01:06:01,310
I'll give you more money than you'll ever get.

903
01:06:01,310 --> 01:06:03,770
Do you know how much money I have?

904
01:06:04,950 --> 01:06:07,170
Tell me how much you want.

905
01:06:07,170 --> 01:06:09,730
I'll give you the money.

906
01:06:10,850 --> 01:06:11,690
Why?

907
01:06:12,290 --> 01:06:13,790
I'll give it to you.

908
01:06:20,150 --> 01:06:25,470
I found it.

909
01:06:26,530 --> 01:06:27,630
Take this bag.

910
01:06:34,710 --> 01:06:35,470
Thank you.

911
01:06:36,410 --> 01:06:39,070
I'll give you 500,000 baht.

912
01:06:39,170 --> 01:06:39,930
Let's go.

913
01:06:43,350 --> 01:06:44,770
I'll give you 500,000 baht.

914
01:06:45,110 --> 01:06:46,170
No, 10 million.

915
01:06:46,730 --> 01:06:47,390
Good luck.

916
01:06:48,050 --> 01:06:49,210
Bye-bye.

917
01:09:42,400 --> 01:09:46,160
We were born with only one life.

918
01:09:46,760 --> 01:09:48,980
But we have two lives.

919
01:09:53,940 --> 01:09:56,480
He saved our lives twice.

920
01:09:57,400 --> 01:09:59,800
I'll repay him.

921
01:10:00,960 --> 01:10:03,860
From now on, you have to take care of yourself.

922
01:12:54,930 --> 01:12:56,010
Han!

923
01:13:02,480 --> 01:13:05,040
This brother saved our lives.

924
01:13:06,260 --> 01:13:08,600
Thank you for saving my life.

925
01:13:10,040 --> 01:13:14,000
I don't want to be shot for 10 million baht.

926
01:13:14,180 --> 01:13:16,420
I only want my sister back.

927
01:13:17,720 --> 01:13:21,660
So, this money is yours.

928
01:13:36,790 --> 01:13:38,370
Thank you again.

929
01:13:38,950 --> 01:13:40,750
We'll see each other again.

930
01:13:48,230 --> 01:13:49,470
What is it, brother?

931
01:13:50,570 --> 01:13:51,210
Tell me.

932
01:13:52,450 --> 01:13:55,910
I came here for 10 million baht.

933
01:13:56,270 --> 01:13:58,770
What I want is to be shot.

934
01:13:59,530 --> 01:14:01,290
I have to win everyone.

935
01:14:01,790 --> 01:14:04,070
So, we have to find someone who can stand.

936
01:14:05,090 --> 01:14:06,050
We have to be shot.

937
01:14:06,910 --> 01:14:09,830
Brother, you've won everyone.

938
01:14:10,550 --> 01:14:11,730
I'm not at risk.

939
01:14:12,610 --> 01:14:13,690
I only follow my wife.

940
01:14:14,950 --> 01:14:15,850
I don't want to be shot.

941
01:14:15,850 --> 01:14:15,910
Who do you want to shoot?

942
01:14:16,710 --> 01:14:22,270
In the army, they say that the one who can shoot is the one.

943
01:14:23,230 --> 01:14:24,210
It's no use.

944
01:14:25,510 --> 01:14:26,850
He's been dead for many years.

945
01:14:28,610 --> 01:14:32,370
I'm the only one who can shoot.

946
01:14:42,040 --> 01:14:44,620
If you don't stop, you'll regret it.

947
01:14:49,040 --> 01:14:51,040
Let go of me.

948
01:14:57,100 --> 01:14:57,420
Let go of me.

949
01:15:16,760 --> 01:15:18,140
How can you be shot at me?

950
01:15:40,770 --> 01:15:42,230
You can't escape from me.

951
01:16:26,620 --> 01:16:29,520
Police officers, what are you doing?

952
01:16:30,400 --> 01:16:31,460
It's illegal.

953
01:16:32,260 --> 01:16:34,160
Drop your gun and turn around.

954
01:16:35,580 --> 01:16:38,360
Don't be rude.

955
01:16:39,120 --> 01:16:40,620
Drop your gun.

956
01:16:43,400 --> 01:16:44,580
Drop your gun.

957
01:16:50,980 --> 01:20:15,300
If you want to be shot,

958
01:20:19,010 --> 01:20:21,790
99.99%

959
01:20:21,790 --> 01:20:23,850
with the donation from

960
01:20:23,850 --> 01:20:25,710
Petchpanna Production.

